+- Remaining risks or follow-ups
+  - No public HTTP surface was added for this metering-source story; JSON envelope criteria remain not applicable until a future endpoint consumes these metering outputs.
+  - The source helpers currently accept already-attributed service scope; future live collectors should feed them only after source inventory has been resolved to Yalla service ownership.
+- **Learnings for future iterations:**
+  - Storage and backup GB-month metering should separate period math from usage_event emission: source helpers clip byte-size windows to period/resource/retention lifetimes, while emitters only write attributed billing-grade `usage_events`.
+  - Explicit correction events should set `EventType: store.UsageEventTypeAdjusted`; the default remains `consumed` for normal scanner samples.
