+## 2026-05-19 13:57:02 +03 - BE-0575
+- What was implemented
+  - Completed storage and backup metering source behavior for billing-grade GB-month usage.
+  - Added `BuildStorageGBMonthSample` to prorate persistent-storage byte samples over the billing period and resource lifetime, including deleted-resource historical usage metadata.
+  - Added `BuildBackupStorageGBMonthSample` to prorate backup artefact size over the billing period and retention lifetime, skip failed backups, and preserve retention metadata.
+  - Extended storage and backup usage emitters to accept explicit `adjusted` usage events while preserving `consumed` as the default.
+  - Added focused tests for create/delete mid-period storage proration, backup retention expiry, backup failure skip, and adjustment event emission.
+- Files changed
+  - `internal/controlplane/metering/storage_usage.go`
+  - `internal/controlplane/metering/storage_usage_test.go`
+  - `internal/controlplane/metering/backup_usage.go`
+  - `internal/controlplane/metering/backup_usage_test.go`
+  - `ralph/prd.json`
+  - `ralph/progress.txt`
+- Verification run
+  - `go test ./internal/controlplane/metering -run 'Test(BuildStorageGBMonthSample|StorageUsageEmitterWritesAdjustmentEvents|BuildBackupStorageGBMonthSample|BackupUsageEmitterWritesAdjustmentEvents)'`
+  - `go test ./internal/controlplane/metering`
